<< /A 894 0 R /Alt (Flowchart illustrating the identification of studies via databases and registers. The process begins with records identified from PubMed, WOS, and Cochrane, totaling 14,988. After removing 452 records for various reasons, 14,536 records are screened. Of these, 14,345 are excluded, leaving 191 reports sought for retrieval. Seventy-two reports are not retrieved. Out of 119 reports assessed for eligibility, 104 are excluded for various reasons, resulting in fifteen studies included in the review.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 16 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
